{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enlist in law enforcement or misfortune, take the intensity of combat to a new level and control of the situation in your hands, with the magnificent shooting simulator with 85% realism &quot;Eighteen Gold&quot;. Choose your weapon, prove your worth on the field, rise and compete to enter elite forces where only the best survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eighteen Gold is an action shooter game based on multiplayer mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Eighteen Gold 2</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to feel the harsh truth, the most realistic authentic shooting simulator in the world with 99.9% realism (Note: it is only an approximation of reality, real life cannot be simulated in a video game), over 4 years of research, more than 200 shootings, over 40 tests to create the most realistic shooting simulator in the world, integrated exclusively in Eighteen and Eighteen Gold 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eighteen Gold 2 now features military battles for the ultimate multiplayer shooter experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes: (Eighteen Gold Special Edition)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base Content and 3 DLC Content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of Modes and some Zombies Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good arsenal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Enhancements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Apps:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eighteen Gold Special Edition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eighteen Gold 2</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1280320?t=1770445503","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280320/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770445503","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280320/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770445503","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1280320/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770445503","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enlist in law enforcement or misfortune, take the intensity of combat to a new level and control of the situation in your hands, with the magnificent shooting simulator with 85% realism &quot;Eighteen Gold&quot;. Choose your weapon, prove your worth on the field, rise and compete to enter elite forces where only the best survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eighteen Gold is an action shooter game based on multiplayer mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Eighteen Gold 2</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to feel the harsh truth, the most realistic authentic shooting simulator in the world with 99.9% realism (Note: it is only an approximation of reality, real life cannot be simulated in a video game), over 4 years of research, more than 200 shootings, over 40 tests to create the most realistic shooting simulator in the world, integrated exclusively in Eighteen and Eighteen Gold 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eighteen Gold 2 now features military battles for the ultimate multiplayer shooter experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes: (Eighteen Gold Special Edition)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base Content and 3 DLC Content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of Modes and some Zombies Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragr